  "label": "Antisemitic Trope of Jews Being Unwelcome in Sacred Spaces",
  "description": "A recurring antisemitic trope suggesting that Jewish people are not permitted or are unwelcome in certain religious or historical buildings, such as churches or mosques, often used to incite hatred or exclusion. This trope is historically linked to antisemitic conspiracy theories and religious persecution.",
